    "title": "Best Travel Insurance for Senior Travelers in Asia: Pre-Existing Conditions & Medical Evacuation (2026)",
    "excerpt": "Finding affordable travel insurance with pre-existing condition coverage is the #1 concern for senior travelers to Asia. We compare top providers, explain medical evacuation coverage, and share insider tips.",
    "date": "2026-05-15",
    "author": "Senior-Friendly Travel Asia Team",
